    "turn_text": "Hi everyone and welcome to our May 2018 results US Poverty National webinar. This is Meredith Thoughtson, the Director of Results US Poverty Work and I'm joining you here from Washington DC. We're really thrilled that all of you are on the line and to really ground us in both what's at stake and the kind of policy conversations we should be having. We're going to start off our webinar tonight with Yolanda Gordon. You can see her picture there for those of you following Yolanda on the slides and Yolanda is so thrilled that you joined us for some nice webinar.",
