    "turn_text": "I think that the amount of benefits that are given should be increased. I think that it should be increased so that it's more than $1.40 per meal for individuals receiving SNAP. I also think that if they're going to make worker requirement, they need to add volunteerism into that requirement because a lot of people, while they are looking for jobs, are volunteering in different areas that they're not getting recognition for volunteering. Those will be the two things that I would like to see that instead of cutting it, I would like to see an increase so that people could. Have more funds to just eat better.",
