    "turn_text": "they are there, look, and this is not going to, you know, the first of all, with regard to the work of crime requirements in the 2014 farm bill, we put together a SNAP work training pilot program. And the results are not supposed to come back. Find out if, in fact, there's a wherewithal to employ folks. So they just bypassing that effort. If they do what they want to do with these requirements, you're going to really leave millions of people at grave risk. And for most of the people who can work are working. And there are circumstances where you just pointed out where you leave kids at home by themselves and so forth.",
