    "turn_text": "Thank you. And listen, I'm a believer, you know, they told us with the 2008 farm bill that I was involved with that we We were not going to be able to index the benefits to inflation, that we were not going to expand the asset levels to make sure that we were able to capture more people, that we were not going to be able to increase the benefits. Honestly, we banded together and we won. And they didn't cut off the school lunch program either. We beat them. We can do it again. Thanks for all that you guys are doing. Appreciate it.",
