    "turn_text": "Great, thanks Colin. Greetings everybody from Kansas City. So now I'm going to facilitate our share section and we got some really good stories this month. We haven't done some shares in a while. And so it's going to be good to hear these really inspiring stories. So we're going to start out with Lucinda Winslow and Bill Baker from Connecticut who are going to share about some recent outreach that they have been doing. So you are now on muted, Lucinda. So go for it.",
