    "episode_id": 75093,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/5/75093.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 78,
    "turn_text": "Great. Thank you so much, Bill and Lucendo. We really appreciate all the wonderful work that you've been doing there in Connecticut and reaching out and getting people engaged and new people coming to the conference and all the things. So congratulations and keep up the great work. So now we're going to go to Judy Zobel in Des Moines, who is going to talk to us about the importance of getting to members of Congress during recesses like the one we're in this week. So Judy, you're on muted. Go ahead.",
